              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Pair complementary angles. Each pair has product ",
                "marks": []
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "1",
                "display": false
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ", and the remaining factor is ",
                "marks": []
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "\\tan45^\\circ=1",
                "display": false
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": ".",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "worked": "For $k=1,2,\\ldots,44$,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\tan(k^\\circ)\\tan((90-k)^\\circ)&=\\tan(k^\\circ)\\cot(k^\\circ)\\\\\\tan(k^\\circ)\\tan((90-k)^\\circ)&=\\frac{\\sin(k^\\circ)}{\\cos(k^\\circ)}\\frac{\\cos(k^\\circ)}{\\sin(k^\\circ)}\\\\\\tan(k^\\circ)\\tan((90-k)^\\circ)&=1.\\end{align*}$$\nThere are 44 complementary pairs, leaving $\\tan45^\\circ=1$. Hence the product is\n$$\\begin{align*}\\prod_{j=1}^{89}\\tan(j^\\circ)&=1^{44}\\times1\\\\\\prod_{j=1}^{89}\\tan(j^\\circ)&=1.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
